#: apps/site/src/content-source/docs/message-descriptors.ts
msgid "JWKS-backed ES256/RS256 ID token verification, end_session logout, and refresh single-flight are implemented and locally tested. A real IdP round-trip on an iOS device or simulator is still required before L4 support."
msgstr "JWKS による ES256/RS256 ID token 検証、end_session logout、refresh single-flight は実装済みでローカルテスト済みです。L4 には iOS 実機または simulator の IdP 検証が必要です。"

#: apps/site/src/content-source/docs/message-descriptors.ts
msgid "JWKS-backed ID token verification and cache refresh are implemented and locally tested. A desktop Secret Service and real IdP round-trip are still required before L4 support."
msgstr "JWKS による ID token 検証と cache refresh は実装済みでローカルテスト済みです。L4 には desktop Secret Service と IdP 検証が必要です。"

#: apps/site/src/content-source/docs/message-descriptors.ts
